[en.CHARACTER_MUDBRIAR_NAME]
Mudbriar

[en.CHARACTER_MUDBRIAR_DESC]
Like his fiancée, Maud Pie, who led the rock farm, Mudbriar was often seen by other ponies as expressionless and occasionally rigid, lacking flexibility. However, he excelled in expressing the precision of things and relied on his exceptional memory to extract intricate details from his so-called “Thought Palace” and conduct systematic analysis, which was what initially attracted Maud Pie to him.

[zh.CHARACTER_MUDBRIAR_NAME]
泥枝

[zh.CHARACTER_MUDBRIAR_DESC]
和他的未婚妻，采石农场的领导者石灰派一样，泥枝在其他小马眼中总是面无表情且偶尔古板不知变通。但他精通于表达事物的准确性，并且依靠他极强的记忆力，从他的所谓“思维殿堂”提取出许多事物的细枝末节并进行系统分析，这也正是他最初吸引石灰派的地方。
